Error [E0040]: `async` is not in Jet; use `tasks.spawn` instead
  --> tests/ui/async_await_teaching.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     async(42);
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Jet uses blocking tasks and channels, not async/await — simpler and race-free
 Fix: import `std.tasks as tasks` and call `tasks.spawn(() => your_work())`
